+# Corpus fetching
+
+## Rate limit
+
+The repository does not record the per-domain rate limit that the corpus fetch
+actually encountered. In particular, neither the number of visits allowed per
+window nor the window length is available. The cooldown applied after a breach
+is also not recorded. `GATE1.md` says only that fetching was rate-limited and
+performed incrementally; no fetch script or request log is included from which
+the missing values could be recovered.
+
+## CDN and mirror hosts
+
+The only file-serving host recorded by the project is
+`raw.githubusercontent.com`. The header of `manifest.tsv` says the corpus files
+were fetched raw through that host. The repository does not identify any other
+CDN or mirror host as having been used, so none are asserted here.
